    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608820/extras/e65042c977139d7ca9a66756657406a3.poster.avif?t=1641251718\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608820/extras/e65042c977139d7ca9a66756657406a3.webm?t=1641251718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>* Play 18 holes, front 9, back 9 or driving range<br>* Solo, Local 2P, VsCPU, Online 2P PVP<br>* 12 unique characters<br>* 15 different clubs <br>* 2D open world golf island, explore and drive the golf cart across the entire map<br>* Throw grenades at the opposite player to knock them out of bounds or into water <br>* Zoom-able MiniMap <br>* hook, slice, spin &amp; super shot.<br>* Sand, water, fairway, rough, green, out of bounds, path and tee areas (+ slime &amp; smoke)<br>* Driving range mini-game<br>* Fighting platformer minigame featuring all 12 characters<br>* 35+ music tracks<br>* Full multiplayer gamepad support<br>* Steam remote play for 2 player multiplayer over internet<br>* Network support for 2 player over LAN<br>* Online PvP with chat and steam leaderboards<br>* TATE mode<br>* Tutorial<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608820/extras/6fc4aa119f3c9a07079dce00dfa63bea.poster.avif?t=1641251718\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608820/extras/6fc4aa119f3c9a07079dce00dfa63bea.webm?t=1641251718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>OGgolf is played using standard golf rules, your main focus when playing this game should be on the mini map, zoom in and out with the trigger buttons &amp; pan with the right stick, take wind into consideration and select the right club for the remaining distance, hold the fast rotation button or rotate without holding for a more precise movement, add optional spin, then press action button for a 3 click swing. Players may have passive strengths or weaknesses or special moves activated by pressing specific buttons. Open the overhead map to find your next location and drive there in the golf cart! Full keyboard and gamepad support. Look under controls in the option menu for a complete button list.<br><br>** Check community hub for longplay videos **<br>** Or CLICK HERE  for OGgolf longplay videos  **<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608820/extras/b84d7d1e50fecc22769ff7371ab3f81a.poster.avif?t=1641251718\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608820/extras/b84d7d1e50fecc22769ff7371ab3f81a.webm?t=1641251718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608820/extras/038a94e2ba6221cc4583c2e16eef1c27.avif?t=1641251718\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608820/extras/0e6778434c8458b8a3b272312b32d19a.avif?t=1641251718\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608820/extras/374ca109b2066d0a179c633172c63cc0.avif?t=1641251718\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608820/extras/3cd6fadc70774090e8bb42b3f20e7df9.avif?t=1641251718\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608820/extras/20e4d