e played with the speedrun option enabled to compete in a global steam leaderboard for fastest time or disabled to compete for best score.<br><br><strong>2 PLAYER</strong>: Local offline multiplayer played on the same computer. This mode can also be used to play over steam using the &quot;Remote Play Together&quot; feature. Check out  for more details.<br><br><strong>VS CPU</strong>: Compete against all 12 characters controlled by uniquely tuned computer Ai opponents! Earn trophy's for each win. Gain wins for the &quot;offline wins&quot; leaderoard.<br><br><strong>LOCAL NETWORK GAME</strong>: 2 player match played over a local area network.<br><br><strong>ONLINE</strong>: Online PVP vs other steam users. Features text chat and steam leaderboard for most wins. <br><br><strong>DRIVING RANGE MINI GAME</strong>: Get points by hitting objects and destroying things with your golf ball, you have 3 minutes. Driving range is played in the driving range area.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608820/extras/d8a744671fbd4556c066c4aa64762c8b.poster.avif?t=1641251718\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608820/extras/d8a744671fbd4556c066c4aa64762c8b.webm?t=1641251718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608820/extras/3a378def2344185ebe123ddd52e25c8e.webp?t=1641251718\" /></div><br>&quot;Best golf game ever&quot; - Hex DSL",
